              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwakulima mu mgunda wakwe tacikola yakulya yejinji. Nambo mundu jwakwamba kuya yindu yangali mate, tacilaga kwakogoya.",
