          "text": "Mundu jwakusapeleka cikamucisyo kwa ŵandu ŵakulaga, ngasasoŵa kandu, nambo mundu jwakusisa ngope jakwe melepe ni kulolaga kumbali jine kuti akawona ŵakulagawo, ŵandu ŵajinji tacimlwesa.",
